@startuml "Événements de scaling"

title Événements de scaling

participant "Monitoring\n(Prometheus)" as Monitoring
participant "Load Balancer\n(HAProxy)" as LB
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "Cache Layer\n(Redis)" as Cache
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

Monitoring -> Monitoring: High CPU detected
Monitoring -> LB: Add new instance
LB -> LB: Update routing table

Frontend -> Frontend: New instance starting
Frontend -> Cache: Warm up cache
Frontend -> DB: Initialize connection pool
Frontend -> LB: Instance ready

@enduml